flowchart TD
    A["Select trusted first-parent source and derive version"]
    B["Authenticated GET exact public repo/push eligibility and Releases; read success leaves writes unverified; fail closed before checks/builds, private build_only bypasses credentials only"]
    C["Assemble exact assets and private evidence"]
    D["Check metadata, checksums, committed installers and platform records"]
    E["Inspect all platform archives and evidence"]
    F["Controller constructs validated receipt; backend trusts caller validation and serialization"]
    G{"Existing matching release"}
    H["Create STAGING draft"]
    I{"READY or STAGING"}
    J["Verify and reuse READY assets"]
    K["Recover or reset STAGING draft with explicit intended tag, upload missing assets"]
    L["Verify remote assets and mark draft READY with explicit intended tag"]
    M["Globally serialized drain verifies and publishes READY drafts with explicit intended tag; scheduled or manual drain can retry"]
    N["Reconcile latest to highest confirmed published ordinal; verify newly published release identity and all anonymous asset digests"]
    O["Errors in A through N or recovery P reject; sanitized HTTP status, transport/JSON errors; conflicts and missing evidence stop preparation or drain"]
    P["Scheduled recovery lists missing sources and dispatches bounded retries when activation is configured"]
    Q["Loopback-only draft staging prototype uses test API"]
    A -->|valid| B
    B -->|success| C
    C --> D
    D -->|valid| E
    E -->|accepted| F
    F --> G
    G -->|no| H
    G -->|yes| I
    H --> K
    I -->|READY| J
    I -->|STAGING| K
    J -->|valid| M
    K -->|complete| L
    L -->|ready| M
    M -->|successful drain including empty queue| N
    R["Read-only verify with trusted exact receipt and release ID; API403 falls back to authenticated metadata plus anonymous release/latest pages and all15 downloads"]
    S["Transport failure: published-but-verification-pending with nonzero exit; explicit verify resumes without uploads or latest mutation"]
    N -->|newly published rows| R
    R -->|transport failure| S
    R -->|identity or bytes mismatch| O
    S -->|read-only resume| R
    P --> A
